 judge call cost this run to the `cell_estimate_usd` floor, or the first uncached call of a fresh run with empty caches is estimated at anything but the floor | tracer | | |

## Non-goals
- Wiring labels and critiques into reflective records, scoring, or the evolve preflight (c5 closes those halves of parent AC-2, AC-4, and AC-7).
- Building the panel or choosing paid-tier rollouts (c3, c5); this curd labels and critiques whatever tasks and rows callers pass.
- External task loaders, the contamination scan, and the `contaminated` field (c2); this curd only reads them.
- Hand-labelling the calibration set; the maintainer fills `benchmark/judge/calibration.json`.
- Changes to `src/**`, `prompts/**`, or any tilth binary behavior.
- Bumping the crate or npm version (fork law).

## Provenance (tier 2 only)
- briesearch: Judge, reflection, and proposer calls authenticate through `claude -p` with `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` from `claude setup-token`; `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` overrides it under `-p`, `--bare` refuses OAuth, and `total_cost_usd` is a client-side estimate; artifact: /root/.local/share/cheese/paulnsorensen-tilth/research/benchmark-subscription-harness-auth/benchmark-subscription-harness-auth.md
